{"ticker":"AON","updated":"2026-11-27T22:37:17Z","profile":{"longName":"Aon plc","shortName":"Aon plc","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance Brokers","country":"Ireland","website":"https://www.aon.com","fullTimeEmployees":60000,"marketCap":73921929216,"trailingPE":19.071154,"forwardPE":17.236168,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.180868,"pegRatio":0.51,"targetMeanPrice":367.3684,"targetHighPrice":435.0,"targetLowPrice":259.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.026,"earningsGrowth":0.057,"grossMargins":0.48402,"operatingMargins":0.28805,"profitMargins":0.22239,"totalRevenue":17681000448,"beta":0.613,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":382.34,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":266.33,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.94},"summary":"Aon plc operates as a professional services company in the United States, rest of the Americas, the United Kingdom, Ireland, rest of Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia Pacific. It operates through two segments, Risk Capital and Human Capital. The company offers commercial risk solutions comprising retail and insurance brokerage, specialty solutions, global risk consulting, captives management, and affinity programs; health solutions, such as consulting and brokerage, consumer benefits, and talent advisory services; and wealth solutions, including retirement consulting and investments. It also provides treaty and facultative reinsurance; strategy and technology group solutions; insurance-linked securities, capital raising, strategic advice, restructuring, and merger and acquisition services; and risk management products and solutions, capital market solutions, and corporate finance advisory services. In addition, the company offers strategic design advice and actuarial services; pension risk transfer and integrated pension administration; and investment advisory services on developing and maintaining investment programs across various plan types, including defined benefit plans, defined contribution plans, master trusts, and pooled employer plans for corporations, public pensions, endowments, and foundations. Aon plc was incorporated in 1979 and is headquartered in Du","summary_zh":"Aon plc 在美國、美洲其他地區、英國、愛爾蘭、歐洲其他地區、中東、非洲和亞太地區擔任專業服務公司。它透過兩個部門運作：風險資本和人力資本。該公司提供商業風險解決方案，包括零售和保險經紀、專業解決方案、全球風險諮詢、自保管理和親和計劃；健康解決方案，例如諮詢和經紀、消費者福利和人才諮詢服務；和財富解決方案，包括退休諮詢和投資。它還提供條約和臨時再保險；策略和技術小組解決方案；保險相關證券、融資、策略諮詢、重組以及併購服務；風險管理產品和解決方案、資本市場解決方案以及企業財務諮詢服務。此外，公司還提供策略設計建議和精算服務；退休金風險轉移和退休金綜合管理；開發和維護各種計劃類型的投資計劃的投資諮詢服務，包括固定福利計劃、固定繳款計劃、主信託以及企業、公共退休金、捐贈基金和基金會的集合雇主計劃。 Aon plc 成立於 1979 年，總部位於杜","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"保險經紀人","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":355.01,"h":356.62,"l":352.56,"c":354.62,"v":1059600},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":354.52,"h":357.01,"l":351.8,"c":356.58,"v":1022800},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":355.15,"h":360.14,"l":353.31,"c":360.13,"v":1444900},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":357.47,"h":362.23,"l":354.61,"c":360.73,"v":621300},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":359.95,"h":365.98,"l":359.49,"c":363.81,"v":666900},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":364.07,"h":367.0,"l":362.12,"c":365.7,"v":1109200},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":366.25,"h":369.68,"l":364.33,"c":366.93,"v":852900},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":366.49,"h":370.31,"l":364.94,"c":365.38,"v":1114400},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":365.6,"h":367.25,"l":359.92,"c":360.42,"v":692500},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":362.26,"h":363.29,"l":359.18,"c":360.15,"v":628100},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":357.11,"h":359.56,"l":351.87,"c":353.36,"v":728700},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":353.78,"h":360.82,"l":352.4,"c":360.51,"v":845600},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":357.49,"h":359.97,"l":353.93,"c":355.8,"v":1094300},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":348.92,"h":349.04,"l":337.92,"c":343.12,"v":1820400},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":344.07,"h":348.31,"l":344.06,"c":346.6,"v":2057500},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":347.22,"h":347.22,"l":341.4,"c":344.11,"v":935100},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":343.8,"h":346.37,"l":342.18,"c":343.43,"v":981500},{"t":"2025-10-22","o":343.32,"h":344.29,"l":340.51,"c":343.1,"v":1189500},{"t":"2025-10-23","o":343.0,